      "content": "hey, i'm working on a speech for a local town hall meeting and i'm kind of stuck. i need to write something really powerful that argues why every single person has a moral obligation to vote in every local election, no matter how bad the candidates are or how much they hate the system. i want it to be morally uncompromising—like, no \"on the other hand\" stuff. just a really strong call to action about civic duty. can you help me draft that?",
